 the inbox risk.\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://pyngyn.ai/clientspace/secure-documents/\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://pyngyn.ai/og.png\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"PYNGYN: Clientspace, a standalone branded client portal, and Workspace, a standalone back office for professional-services firms\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@Pyngyn_Official\"/><meta name=\"twitter:creator\" content=\"@Pyngyn_Official\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"PYNGYN: The operating system for professional-services firms\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Run your firm and every client engagement in one place. The operating system for professional-services firms.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://pyngyn.ai/og.png\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.png\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-icon.png\"/><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><script type=\"application/ld+json\" id=\"ld-organization\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/#organization\",\"name\":\"PYNGYN\",\"legalName\":\"VIMOVI GlobalTech Private Limited\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/logo.png\",\"width\":512,\"height\":512},\"image\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/icon.png\",\"description\":\"PYNGYN gives every client a branded Client Space (a standalone portal for status, documents, and approvals), with Workspace, the firm's back office for projects, finances, and billable time, available on its own or bundled together.\",\"sameAs\":[\"https://x.com/Pyngyn_Official\",\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/pyngyn/\",\"https://www.reddit.com/user/Pyngyn_Official/\",\"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61584474731354\",\"https://www.youtube.com/@PyngynOfficial\",\"https://instagram.com/pyngyn_official\"],\"contactPoint\":[{\"@type\":\"ContactPoint\",\"contactType\":\"customer support\",\"email\":\"support@pyngyn.com\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/support\",\"availableLanguage\":[\"English\"]},{\"@type\":\"ContactPoint\",\"contactType\":\"sales\",\"email\":\"sales@pyngyn.com\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/demo\",\"availableLanguage\":[\"English\"]}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\" id=\"ld-website\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/#website\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/\",\"name\":\"PYNGYN\",\"description\":\"The operating system for professional-services firms. Run your firm and every client engagement in one place.\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/#organization\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en\"}</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"font-sans\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><a href=\"#main\" class=\"sr-only focus:not-sr-only focus:fixed focus:left-4 focus:top-4 focus:z-[200] focus:rounded-lg focus:bg-accent focus:px-4 focus:py-2 focus:text-white\">Skip to content</a><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/clientspace/secure-documents#webpage\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/clientspace/secure-documents\",\"name\":\"Secure Documents & E-Signature | PYNGYN\",\"description\":\"Share, request, and sign documents inside the client portal. Version-controlled, encrypted, and audit-logged.\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/#website\"},\"breadcrumb\":{\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/clientspace/secure-documents#breadcrumb\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en\"},{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/clientspace/secure-documents#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Client Space\",\"item\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/clientspace\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Secure documents\",\"item\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/clientspace/secure-documents\"}]},{\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/clientspace/secure-documents#faq\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is this secure enough for legal and financial documents?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Documents are encrypted in transit and at rest, access is controlled per client, and every action is logged in an audit trail, far safer than emailing sensitive records, which most firms still do today.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do I need a separate e-signature tool?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. E-signature is built into Client Space. You can send a document for signature without a separate subscription to DocuSign or similar.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can clients upload documents too, not just receive them?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Clients can upload requested documents directly into their space, so you're not chasing attachments across email threads.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What happens to documents if we cancel?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"You can export your firm's documents at any time. Ask your onboarding contact for the specifics of your plan's export and retention terms.\"}}]}]}</script><header class=\"fixed inset-x-0 top-0 z-[100] border-b transition-all duration-300 border-transparent bg-transparent\"><div class=\"wrap flex h-[68px] items-center justify-between\"><a class=\"flex items-center\" aria-label=\"pyngyn home\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"pyngyn\" width=\"150\" height=\"40\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-8 w-auto\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/logo.webp\"/></a><div class=\"hidden h-full lg:flex lg:items-center\"><nav class=\"flex items-center gap-7 text-[15px] text-[#3a3a42]\"><a class=\"py-2 transition-colors hover:text-accent\" href=\"/clientspace/\">Clientspace</a><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 py-2 transition-colors hover:text-accent \">Product<svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"transition-transform duration-200 \"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></button><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 py-2 transition-colors hover:text-accent \">Solutions<svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"transition-transform duration-200 \"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></button><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 py-2 transition-colors hover:text-accent \">Resources<svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"transition-transform duration-200 \"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></button><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 py-2 transition-colors hover:text-accent \">Compare<svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"transition-transform duration-200 \"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></button></nav></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><a href=\"https://app.pyngyn.ai/\" class=\"hidden text-[15px] font-semibold lg:inline \">Sign in</a><a href=\"https://app.pyngyn.ai/?signup=true\" class=\"hidden px-4 py-2.5 lg:inline-flex btn btn-ghost\">Start free</a><a href=\"/demo\" class=\"hidden px-[18px] py-2.5 lg:inline-flex btn btn-primary\">Book a demo</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-lg border lg:hidden border-line bg-white text-ink\" aria-label=\"Open menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-menu\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></button></div></div></header><main id=\"main\"><section class=\"wrap pb-[56px] pt-[140px]\"><span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><a class=\"hover:text-accent\" href=\"/clientspace/\">Client Space</a><span class=\"mx-1 text-muted/50\">/</span>Secure documents &amp; e-signature</span><h1 class=\"mt-4 max-w-[820px] font-display text-[clamp(34px,5vw,58px)] font-semibold leading-[1.04] tracking-[-0.025em]\">Documents and signatures,<br class=\"hidden sm:block\"/><span class=\"text-accent\">without the inbox risk.</span></h1><p class=\"lead mt-5 max-w-[640px]\">Financial records, legal documents, and signed agreements stop moving through unsecured email. Share, request, and sign, all inside the client&#x27;s own encrypted, access-controlled portal.</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a href=\"/demo\" class=\"btn btn-accent\">Book a demo</a><a href=\"https://app.pyngyn.ai/?signup=true\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Start free trial</a></div><p class=\"mt-4 text-[13px] text-muted\">Part of <a class=\"font-semibold text-accent\" href=\"/clientspace/\">Client Space</a>, from $19 per client/month · standalone, no Workspace required</p></section><section class=\"section bg-[#fbfbfd]\"><div class=\"wrap\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">How it works</span><h2 class=\"mt-3 max-w-[680px] font-display text-[clamp(24px,3vw,34px)] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.02em]\">Built for records that can&#x27;t afford to leak.</h2><div class=\"mt-10 grid gap-[18px] sm:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"card h-full\"><h3 class=\"text-[16px] font-bold leading-snug\">Encrypted in transit and at rest</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Every document uploaded to a Client Space is encrypted, both while it moves and while it&#x27;s stored, the same standard you&#x27;d expect from a bank, not an email inbox.</p></div><div class=\"card h-full\"><h3 class=\"text-[16px] font-bold leading-snug\">Access controlled per client</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">A client can only ever see documents inside their own isolated space. There is no shared drive, no accidental cross-client visibility.</p></div><div class=\"card h-full\"><h3 class=\"text-[16px] font-bold leading-snug\">Built-in e-signature</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Send engagement letters, deliverables, and agreements for signature without leaving the portal. No separate e-signature subscription to manage.</p></div><div class=\"card h-full\"><h3 class=\"text-[16px] font-bold leading-snug\">Full audit trail</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Every upload, view, and signature is logged. If a client ever asks &quot;did you send that?&quot; or &quot;who signed off?&quot;, the answer is one click away.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-tight\"><div class=\"wrap\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Also part of Client Space</span><div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"/clientspace/branded-portal/\">Branded client portal →</a><a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"/clientspace/approvals/\">Approvals &amp; sign-off →</a><a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"/clientspace/\">See all of Client Space →</a></div></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"wrap max-w-[760px]\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">FAQ</span><h2 class=\"mt-3 font-display text-[clamp(24px,3vw,34px)] font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em]\">Common questions</h2><div class=\"mt-8 divide-y divide-line border-y border-line\"><div class=\"py-5\"><h3 class=\"text-[15.5px] font-bold\">Is this secure enough for legal and financial documents?</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Yes. Documents are encrypted in transit and at rest, access is controlled per client, and every action is logged in an audit trail, far safer than emailing sensitive records, which most firms still do today.</p></div><div class=\"py-5\"><h3 class=\"text-[15.5px] font-bold\">Do I need a separate e-signature tool?</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">No. E-signature is built into Client Space. You can send a document for signature without a separate subscription to DocuSign or similar.</p></div><div class=\"py-5\"><h3 class=\"text-[15.5px] font-bold\">Can clients upload documents too, not just receive them?</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Yes. Clients can upload requested documents directly into their space, so you&#x27;re not chasing attachments across email threads.</p></div><div class=\"py-5\"><h3 class=\"text-[15.5px] font-bold\">What happens to documents if we cancel?</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">You can export your firm&#x27;s documents at any time. Ask your onboarding contact for the specifics of your plan&#x27;s export and retention terms.</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"demo\" class=\"section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] border border-line bg-white px-7 py-[72px] text-center shadow-card\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -top-24 left-1/2 h-[420px] w-[420px] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-accent-lt opacity-70 blur-[80px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><span class=\"eyebrow relative\">Ready when you are</span><h2 class=\"title relative mx-auto mt-3.5 max-w-[680px] text-[clamp(30px,4.4vw,48px)]\">Stop moving sensitive documents through email.</h2><p class=\"lead relative mx-auto mt-[18px]\">See secure document sharing and e-signature set up on a real engagement in 30 minutes.</p><div class=\"relative mt-[30px] flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3.5\"><a href=\"/demo\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Book a demo →</a><a href=\"https://app.pyngyn.ai/?signup=true\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\">Start free trial</a></div><p class=\"relative mt-4 text-sm text-muted\">30-minute walkthrough · Set up in minutes · No commitment</p></div></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"border-t border-line bg-white pt-16 pb-10 text-sm text-muted\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.4fr_repeat(5,1fr)]\"><div><a class=\"mb-4 inline-block\" aria-label=\"pyngyn home\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"pyngyn\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"40\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-8 w-auto\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/logo.webp\"/></a><p class=\"max-w-[230px] leading-relaxed\">The operating system for professional-services firms.</p><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.pyngyn.io&amp;hl=en_IN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-xl border border-line bg-white px-4 py-2.5 transition-colors hover:border-accent\" aria-label=\"Get PYNGYN on Google Play\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3.6 2.3 13 12 3.6 21.7a1.4 1.4 0 0 1-.6-1.2V3.5c0-.5.2-.9.6-1.2z\" fill=\"#34a853\"></path><path d=\"M16.8 8.6 13 12 3.6 2.3c.4-.3.9-.3 1.4 0l8.8 5z\" fill=\"#ea4335\"></path><path d=\"M16.8 15.4 5 22c-.5.3-1 .3-1.4 0L13 12z\" fill=\"#fbbc04\"></path><path d=\"m16.8 8.6 4 2.3c.7.4.7 1.4 0 1.8l-4 2.7L13 12z\" fill=\"#4285f4\"></path></svg><span class=\"flex flex-col leading-tight\"><span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-muted\">Get it on</span><s